        "Id": 24,
        "ActionId": 24,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "Good to hear your voice. I'm alright. I've managed to reach the signal amplifier, so we should be able to talk without any trouble for now. However...",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 25,
        "ActionId": 25,
        "Type": 301,
        "EndAnim": "DialogDisable",
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "My instruments show our positions clearly, and we're indeed drifting further away from each other. It seems the isolation tests we've run haven't given us anything consistent to work with.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 26,
        "ActionId": 26,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "I'm sorry it didn't work this time either.",
            27
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 27,
        "ActionId": 27,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Even after I promised I'd help make your wish come true.",
