    {
        "Id": 37,
        "ActionId": 37,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "This event was organized by a member of the WGAA. Drawing inspiration from the abandoned trains of the Golden Age, he recreated their carriages as a series of curated scenes from different cultures."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 38,
        "ActionId": 38,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "The plan drew little enthusiasm, however, and few showed any interest or signed up for the preview tests. When he gave out flyers at the square three days ago, Noan was the only one who reached out and took one."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 39,
        "ActionId": 39,
        "Type": 306
    },
    {
        "Id": 40,
        "ActionId": 40,
