    {
        "Id": 43,
        "ActionId": 43,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            1,
            "Noan",
            "The rules are that we'd set off separately in this maze-like train, and we'd have to make the same choice independently at each isolation test. Only then do our paths align and bring us to the same carriage.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 44,
        "ActionId": 44,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "Well... looks like the good ending is off the table for this round. If someone turned this into a game, I have a feeling that the difficulty alone would tank its reviews.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 45,
        "ActionId": 45,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "Given that we keep getting the bad ending, why don't we save and restart? I can reach out to the organizer to put this run on hold, and we can start fresh from the top.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 46,
        "ActionId": 46,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "How about we swap routes in the next round? I'll take the \"Decay\" path, and you can take the \"Revival\" one. At the very least, you'd get to see better scenery and make the trip worth your while.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 47,
        "ActionId": 47,
        "Type": 401,
        "Params": [
            1,
            36
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 48,
        "ActionId": 48,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "I don't want to give up yet.",
            49,
            "I want to keep trying.",
            49
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 49,
        "ActionId": 49,
        "Type": 401,
        "BeginDelay": 1000.0,
        "Params": [
            1,
            6244
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 50,
        "ActionId": 50,
