            9
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 51,
        "ActionId": 51,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "...Why?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 52,
        "ActionId": 52,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Turning over your reply in his mind, Noan has his suspicions about your reason, but it is one he does not quite dare believe."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 53,
        "ActionId": 53,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "...Can I venture a guess that it's the same answer as before?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 54,
        "ActionId": 54,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1,
            11
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 55,
        "ActionId": 55,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "\"Because it is your wish.\"",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 56,
        "ActionId": 56,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Because it is your wish.",
            57
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 57,
        "ActionId": 57,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Your voice and Noan's ring out at the same time, the same words converging over the comms. It reminds Noan of the last time he heard that phrase."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 58,
        "ActionId": 58,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "I remember the organizer telling me that the test had to be done in pairs, so I needed to find a partner, and you were the only person who came to mind.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 59,
        "ActionId": 59,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "I had a whole speech ready to win you over, but you said yes the moment I finished asking without hesitation.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 60,
        "ActionId": 60,
        "Type": 301,
        "EndAnim": "DialogDisable",
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "I even asked if you wanted to know more, like why I needed the help in the first place. But all you said was, \"Because it is your wish.\"",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 61,
        "ActionId": 61,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "It was clear how much this meant to you.",
            62
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 62,
        "ActionId": 62,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "You've been trying hard to win the last few attempts.",
            63
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 63,
        "ActionId": 63,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "But you're welcome to share your reasons with me.",
            64
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 64,
        "ActionId": 64,
        "Type": 301,
        "BeginAnim": "DialogEnable",
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "The sound on the other end of the comms cuts out. Noan has been charting the map and coming up with more optimized routes, but your words give him pause."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 65,
        "ActionId": 65,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1,
            14
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 66,
        "ActionId": 66,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "The truth is, I couldn't tell you exactly why myself, Commandant. I was just taking a walk through the square when I saw the organizer pitch his idea to anyone who'd listen.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 67,
        "ActionId": 67,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1,
            15
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 68,
        "ActionId": 68,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "Sweating and worn down, he'd clearly been at it for hours. But he kept going even when people brushed him off, and he was just as earnest as ever.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 69,
        "ActionId": 69,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "When I took the flyer from him, he told me that even if most people didn't believe in his idea with the abandoned trains, he'd still see it through regardless. That was what he wanted to express—",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 70,
        "ActionId": 70,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "\"Because at its heart, civilization is nothing more than a dead tree learning to bloom again.\"",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 71,
        "ActionId": 71,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "You understood him.",
            72,
            "You agreed with him.",
            72
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 72,
        "ActionId": 72,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1,
            11
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 73,
        "ActionId": 73,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "Perhaps, but it was like deja vu. I saw glimpses of things I'd seen in others, and some I recognized from my own life.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 74,
        "ActionId": 74,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "Compared to all the bright, colorful ideas, the abandoned trains spoke to me more. Fighting through impossible odds and finding life in something forgotten... How do you know there isn't a path unless you walk it?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 75,
        "ActionId": 75,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "So I find myself hoping it succeeds and proves something to the doubters. But on a more personal note... I wanted you to be here to see it, Commandant. Call it a small indulgence of mine.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 76,
        "ActionId": 76,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "Though I'll admit, it's been far more difficult than I anticipated. This is already our fifth test, and yet...",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 77,
        "ActionId": 77,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "The entire test is being recorded for official reports and promotional use. But if you two fail to meet as planned, it would undermine the core idea that civilizations can converge. Without that, you won't be able to convince other creators, let alone attract more participants to try it."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 78,
        "ActionId": 78,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1,
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 79,
        "ActionId": 79,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "I've gone over every possible route. At this stage, you'll always arrive at the same final carriage, no matter what you choose, so don't overthink it. Just go with whatever feels right.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 80,
        "ActionId": 80,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "What about you?",
            81
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 81,
        "ActionId": 81,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "There are more options and quite a few possible endpoints on my end, but thanks to my earlier miscalculation, every path goes in the exact opposite direction from you if I continue.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 82,
        "ActionId": 82,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "It seems like there's no way for us to meet at the same endpoint this time around. Perhaps the best we can do is push through quickly and meet up outside the carriages? We can give it another go if you want.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 83,
        "ActionId": 83,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "Then again... there is one other possibility I worked out, but it's a long shot.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 84,
        "ActionId": 84,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "What do you need me to do?",
            85
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 85,
        "ActionId": 85,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "In theory, I'm the only one who needs to do anything. But after what you said earlier... I find myself getting a little greedy. There's one thing I want to hear from you first.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 86,
        "ActionId": 86,
        "Type": 301,
        "EndAnim": "DialogDisable",
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "So answer me this one question: Do you want to see me, Commandant?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 87,
        "ActionId": 87,
        "Type": 401,
        "Params": [
            1,
            36
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 88,
        "ActionId": 88,
        "Type": 302,
        "EndDelay": 1000.0,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Yes.",
            89,
            "Of course.",
            89,
            "I want to see you.",
            89
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 89,
        "ActionId": 89,
        "Type": 401,
        "Params": [
            1,
            181
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 90,
        "ActionId": 90,
        "Type": 301,
        "BeginAnim": "DialogEnable",
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "Alright. I see.",
            1
        ]
    },
