    {
        "Id": 151,
        "ActionId": 151,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "I'm right here. No more waiting. No more making your way to somewhere far off.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 152,
        "ActionId": 152,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "You just needed to reach the end, and I took care of the rest and came all the way to where you are. That was how we could meet as fast as possible.",
