    {
        "Id": 156,
        "ActionId": 156,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "Noan steps forward and takes your hand, leading you to a window. Up close, you can see carefully chosen decorations tucked into every corner of the original interior of the carriage, making the space feel new."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 157,
        "ActionId": 157,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "I brought everything I could carry. I wanted to put together a decent scene for you to take in.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 158,
        "ActionId": 158,
        "Type": 301,
        "EndAnim": "DialogDisable",
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "I ran the numbers, and there was only enough time for one of us to change course, and barely at that. So I turned around and went as fast as I could, took the other route, and got to your carriage ahead of you.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 159,
        "ActionId": 159,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "So this is the \"miracle\" that actually comes true.",
            160
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 160,
        "ActionId": 160,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Was it my answer that made the difference?",
            161
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 161,
        "ActionId": 161,
        "Type": 301,
        "BeginAnim": "DialogEnable",
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "Always. It's always been you from the very beginning.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 162,
        "ActionId": 162,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1,
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 163,
        "ActionId": 163,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "I had my doubts. Would this one fail too? Would putting you through these tests again and again wear on you? None of that would have mattered if it were only me, but you're different.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 164,
        "ActionId": 164,
        "Type": 204,
        "Params": [
            1,
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 165,
        "ActionId": 165,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "So when you said you cared about my wish, and that you would give me your trust and company... That was what gave me the courage to try.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 166,
        "ActionId": 166,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "Commandant, may I keep coming to you for your answer in the future during moments like this?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 167,
        "ActionId": 167,
        "Type": 302,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Every time. My answer will always be yes.",
            168,
            "Next time, I can be the one who comes to you.",
            168
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 168,
        "ActionId": 168,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "That's good enough for me, Commandant.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 169,
        "ActionId": 169,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Noan",
            "The moment you said you wanted to see me, that alone made it all worth it. With that courage, I refused to let us miss each other just because the odds were against it. I'd go against the current to find my way to you.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 170,
        "ActionId": 170,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "His words continue, his gaze drifting toward you. Sunlight spills through the window, filling the carriage at last, and the one he has been waiting for is finally with him."
        ]
    },
